    "line": 77,
    "summary": "Path traversal in delete(): filename extracted from avatarUrl is not sanitized for ../ sequences, allowing arbitrary file deletion",
    "failure_scenario": "Attacker sets avatarUrl to '/uploads/avatars/../../config/application.yml' via PUT /users/me/profile (no @URL validation), then uploads a new avatar — delete() resolves Path.of('uploads/avatars', '../../config/application.yml') and deletes the config file"
  },
