    "file": "backend/src/main/java/com/cc91/service/AnnouncementService.java",
    "line": 86,
    "summary": "update() uses findById() (no JOIN FETCH on lazy author) instead of findByIdWithAuthor(), causing an N+1 query when toDTO() accesses getAuthor().getUsername()",
    "failure_scenario": "Admin sends PUT /api/admin/announcements/1 → findById loads Announcement without author → toDTO triggers lazy load → extra SELECT query. findAll() and the public findById() correctly use JOIN FETCH; only update() misses it"
  },
